{"id":"8eb8466c3c417107","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-generic-extension-model.md","title":"Generic Extension is a Model","display":"thm-generic-extension-model — Generic Extension is a Model","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-generic-extension-model","aliases":["58-thm-generic-extension-model","Generic Extension is a Model","M[G] is a CTM"],"display":"thm-generic-extension-model — Generic Extension is a Model","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-generic-extension-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-generic-extension-model</span><span>Generic Extension is a Model</span><span>M[G] is a CTM</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-extension-model — Generic Extension is a Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md\">../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,P,\\le_P,G\\in V\">\\(M,N,P,\\le_P,G\\in V\\)</span> (ground model, extension, forcing order, and generic filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> (the background theory) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (the ordinal class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (the theory-indexed forcing-extension predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md\">../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land P,\\le_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\mathrm{ZFC},P,G)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\mathrm{CTM}_S(N,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\land M\\subseteq N\\land G\\in N\n\\land(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M=\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap N).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land P,\\le_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\mathrm{ZFC},P,G)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\mathrm{CTM}_S(N,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\land M\\subseteq N\\land G\\in N\n\\land(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M=\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap N).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fundamental theorem of forcing: generic extensions preserve ZFC.</li>\n<li>Here <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> is the name-evaluation extension conventionally written <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span>; no unsupported minimal-model claim is used.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M \\cap \\mathrm{Ord} = M[G] \\cap \\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(M \\cap \\mathrm{Ord} = M[G] \\cap \\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>: ordinals are preserved.</li>\n<li>The extension is transitive, contains <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>, and contains the generic filter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is countable, then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span> is countable in the ambient universe.</li>\n<li>Key for independence proofs: start with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>, force to get <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span> with new properties.</li>\n<li>The proof of Power Set uses the forcing theorem and the set of names in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> that can be forced into a proposed subset.</li>\n<li>The extension predicate is now the five-place theory-indexed core with the same <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> parameter as the CTM premises and conclusion; its theory is not hidden behind an unrelated existential projection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"76dde059f166d3e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"76dde059f166d3e6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (the theory-indexed forcing-extension predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,P,\\le_P,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land P,\\le_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\le_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\le_P,M)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\mathrm{ZFC},P,G)\\\\\n\\to{}&\\mathrm{CTM}_S(N,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\land M\\subseteq N\\land G\\in N\n\\land(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M=\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap N).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]","display":false},{"tex":"M \\cap \\mathrm{Ord} = M[G] \\cap \\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false}],"bytes":2206,"backlinks":[{"id":"3ec71b553c025f0a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"902106c2351e64fe","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-generic-extension-model.md|58-thm-generic-extension-model]]（batch03）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-determinacy-proof.md]]\n[[58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms.md]]\n[[58-thm-cantor.md]]\n[[58-thm-cardinal-multiplication.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-filter-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-guessing.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection-proper.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection.md]]\n[[58-thm-coanalytic-separation.md]]\n[[58-thm-